    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/5f60fcda465711f82a89700ad6dec900.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD WITH UNEXPECTED SECRETS<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.poster.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.webm?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.mp4?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet home in a peaceful neighborhood, a telescope in the back yard, unfinished projects in the workshop, and a comet in the sky. A peaceful evening broken only by the chirping of crickets conceals the mysteries below the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ADVENTURE TO UNEARTH THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.poster.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.webm?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.mp4?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come to unearth the past and begin your adventure. How deep can you go, and when you can go no further, where then does the path lead?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE THE PUZZLES TO UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/2753bd5bd7e0e24ea129096aab77455f.poster.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/2753bd5bd7e0e24ea129096aab77455f.webm?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/2753bd5bd7e0e24ea129096aab77455f.mp4?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, observe, and engage with Ungrounded\u2019s mechanisms and machinery. Puzzles built into the environment must be overcome to venture forward. The further you travel, the more uncertain the path home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT UNGROUNDED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ungrounded is a first-person puzzle adventure game. Puzzles are part of the environment, and exploration and interaction with the world will provide the answers. At each step, Ungrounded challenges expectations - you are part of a story that is larger than it may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/5f60fcda465711f82a89700ad6dec900.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A WORLD WITH UNEXPECTED SECRETS<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.poster.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.webm?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/ff38bab08d77a59727f076d69c179ab4.mp4?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet home in a peaceful neighborhood, a telescope in the back yard, unfinished projects in the workshop, and a comet in the sky. A peaceful evening broken only by the chirping of crickets conceals the mysteries below the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ADVENTURE TO UNEARTH THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.poster.avif?t=1751825648\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.webm?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859490/extras/7232666046776bef17a85759e64a8b57.mp4?t=1751825648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time has come to unearth the past and 